 before drawing, but it's not present.\r\n   at: draw_list_draw (./servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:4984)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis occurs on both Forward+ and Mobile. The issue happens with the first commit only (no VMA update), or when both commits are applied.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114075#pullrequestreview-3584203693","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114075","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-16T17:28:15Z"},{"id":3588579723,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7V5WGL","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Works great now :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n\r\nI've also tested it on several other demos like the TPS demo, as well as baking lightmaps.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114075#pullrequestreview-3588579723","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114075","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-17T16:31:52Z"},{"id":3722235861,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7d3M_V","state":"APPROVED","body":"Works as expected on Linux (Zorin OS 18) when using the Forward+/Mobile renderers (Vulkan).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114075#pullrequestreview-3722235861","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114075","author_association":"NONE","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T11:51:54Z"},{"id":3745295889,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7fPK4R","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"